<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Pep lifts interim shr, declares div.</title>
<headline>Pep lifts interim shr, declares div.</headline>
<dateline>CAPE TOWN 1997-02-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Half year ended Dec 31, 1996</p>
<p>			(million rand unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr, attrib (cts)     31.1	  vs 27.1</p>
<p>    Div (cts)		 13.0	  vs 0</p>
<p>    Net profit		71.74	 vs 62.38</p>
<p>    Pre-tax		   95.78	 vs 87.99</p>
<p>    Tax			 21.81	 vs 22.45</p>
<p>    Interest paid	   31.58	 vs 23.37</p>
<p>    Turnover	     1,117.35	 vs 965.19</p>
<p>Div payable: March 27</p>
<p>On register: March 14</p>
<p>Full name: Pep Ltd (retailer)</p>
<p>NOTE - The group said that good prospects for agricuture, continuous refurbishment and expansion programmes, aggressive expansion in Southern and East Africa and improved information systems would provide it with a solid base for satisfactory earnings growth in the second half of the year.</p>
<p>-- Cape Town newsroom +27 21 25-2238</p>
